#ASSERT `rate of` (`permit worker` `permit`) `on day` (Date 31 12 2024) EQUALS `the rate stated in an exemption permit (s 8(4))` OF 15
#ASSERT `rate of` (`permit worker` `permit`) `on day` (Date 1 1 2025) EQUALS `the adult rate (s 4)` OF 25
-- P4 revoked with effect from 1 Oct
#ASSERT `rate of` (`permit worker` `revoked permit`) `on day` (Date 30 9 2024) EQUALS `the rate stated in an exemption permit (s 8(4))` OF 15
#ASSERT `rate of` (`permit worker` `revoked permit`) `on day` (Date 1 10 2024) EQUALS `the adult rate (s 4)` OF 25
-- P5 s 8(1)
#ASSERT `a Labour Inspector may issue an exemption permit` (`Permit application` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `a Labour Inspector may issue an exemption permit` (`Permit application` OF FALSE, TRUE, TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `a Labour Inspector may issue an exemption permit` (`Permit application` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `a Labour Inspector may issue an exemption permit` (`Permit application` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE)
-- s 8(5)
