-- ===== s 11AA: unpaid 500, employer able to pay 200 =====
GIVEN involved IS A BOOLEAN, employer IS A BOOLEAN, leave IS A BOOLEAN, d IS A DATE
GIVETH AN `Arrears claim against a person involved`
`claim` involved employer leave d MEANS `Arrears claim against a person involved` OF TRUE, TRUE, involved, employer, leave, 500, 200, d

#ASSERT `the wages recoverable under s 11AA by` `a Labour Inspector` `on` (`claim` TRUE FALSE FALSE (Date 1 4 2016)) EQUALS 300
