-- ===== 2013 Amendment Act s 7 (new entrant 18, highest 16/17 starting-out 20, adult 25) =====
#ASSERT `the rate for a new entrant under the 2013 transition` 18 20 25 2 199 EQUALS 20
#ASSERT `the rate for a new entrant under the 2013 transition` 21 20 25 2 199 EQUALS 21
#ASSERT `the rate for a new entrant under the 2013 transition` 18 20 25 2 200 EQUALS 25
#ASSERT `the rate for a new entrant under the 2013 transition` 18 20 25 3 50 EQUALS 25
#ASSERT `the rate for a new entrant under the 2013 transition` 18 20 25 2.9 199.9 EQUALS 20
